the counterparty. Collateral held varies but primarily includes residential real estate properties.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 8pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.01in;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap; font-size: 8pt;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p></ix:continuation></div>
